1
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:18,270
♪I stretch and yawn
when the sun is high in the sky♪

2
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:23,030
♪A cup of tea and a little tune,
what a carefree life♪

3
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:28,480
♪The fortune teller said
love would come my way this year♪

4
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:32,580
♪But all I see is my food
arriving right on time♪

5
00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:35,670
♪No rush, no worries♪

6
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:38,360
♪Love is all a matter of chance♪

7
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:40,480
♪Flowers bloom and fade♪

8
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:43,380
♪I'd rather take good care
of myself first♪

9
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:45,580
♪Two orioles sing among
the green willows♪

10
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:47,970
♪And I still don't have a boyfriend♪

11
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:50,590
♪My best years are nothing
to worry about♪

12
00:00:50,590 --> 00:00:53,240
♪I'll stay happily single
till I'm old and gray♪

13
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:07,540
=Besties' Coming Fortune=

14
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:09,980
=Episode 17=

15
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:28,000
Both ladies

16
00:01:28,280 --> 00:01:30,120
covered their noses
and mouths with wet cloths,

17
00:01:30,230 --> 00:01:31,640
blocking out most of the smoke.

18
00:01:32,040 --> 00:01:33,510
Once the sedative wears off,

19
00:01:33,510 --> 00:01:34,360
they'll regain consciousness.

20
00:01:36,430 --> 00:01:37,280
Thank you, Imperial Physician.

21
00:01:46,510 --> 00:01:47,360
Song Zhang is dead.

22
00:01:49,070 --> 00:01:49,870
Cangzhu said

23
00:01:50,760 --> 00:01:51,950
that after you expelled her
from the manor,

24
00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:53,670
she sought refuge with the Third Prince.

25
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:55,840
The plan to set fire
to the pleasure boat was her idea.

26
00:01:56,310 --> 00:01:57,000
After it succeeded,

27
00:01:58,760 --> 00:02:00,030
the Third Prince had her killed.

28
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:02,360
It seems

29
00:02:03,120 --> 00:02:04,070
we've now fallen completely

30
00:02:04,070 --> 00:02:05,840
under the Third Prince's watchful eye.

31
00:02:06,310 --> 00:02:07,950
His attack on Yuyuan and Shutiao

32
00:02:08,430 --> 00:02:09,600
was a warning to us.

33
00:02:10,870 --> 00:02:11,990
If we don't find evidence soon,

34
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:13,880
his next target

35
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:15,440
could be the entire Marquis's Manor.

36
00:02:15,630 --> 00:02:16,160
Your Lordship.

37
00:02:17,630 --> 00:02:18,110
Your Lordship.

38
00:02:18,630 --> 00:02:19,320
Chang Qing confessed.

39
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:20,870
He said the Third Prince murdered

40
00:02:20,870 --> 00:02:21,830
the Marquis and his wife.

41
00:02:27,470 --> 00:02:28,990
My parents were
strict military commanders.

42
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:31,040
They would never have disobeyed orders.

43
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:34,200
Why on earth
did the Third Prince kill them?

44
00:02:34,630 --> 00:02:36,880
They never had a chance
to disobey orders,

45
00:02:38,560 --> 00:02:40,390
because the Third Prince killed them

46
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:44,200
before they even set out for battle.

47
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:47,080
Why would he do that?

48
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:48,510
Why?

49
00:02:49,030 --> 00:02:50,480
We're nothing but lowly commoners.

50
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:54,200
Even in the underworld,

51
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:56,880
all we can do is cling
to a miserable existence.

52
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:58,390
If you're angry,

53
00:02:59,080 --> 00:03:00,920
go ahead and kill me to vent your rage.

54
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:04,390
Killing you

55
00:03:05,150 --> 00:03:06,230
would be effortless.

56
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:08,440
But you're the Third Prince's lapdog.

57
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:11,080
I'd rather let him experience

58
00:03:11,750 --> 00:03:12,750
what it's like to be bitten

59
00:03:12,750 --> 00:03:14,440
by his own dog.

60
00:03:18,150 --> 00:03:18,710
Oh no.

61
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:24,200
A mayfly trying to shake a tree.

62
00:03:25,870 --> 00:03:27,230
You don't know your limits.

63
00:03:28,750 --> 00:03:30,230
You'll never defeat him.

64
00:03:31,870 --> 00:03:32,830
Your parents

65
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:35,510
will remain in the underworld,

66
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:37,920
never

67
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:40,800
have

68
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:42,790
their names

69
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:43,990
cleared.

70
00:03:50,400 --> 00:03:50,990
Your Lordship.

71
00:04:05,630 --> 00:04:06,230
Your Lordship.

72
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:07,510
You mustn't drink anymore.

73
00:04:08,590 --> 00:04:09,080
Get out of my way.

74
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:13,710
A mayfly trying to shake a tree.

75
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:16,880
You don't know your limits.

76
00:04:18,310 --> 00:04:19,830
You'll never defeat him.

77
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:23,080
Your parents

78
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:25,760
will remain in the underworld,

79
00:04:26,510 --> 00:04:27,390
never

80
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:28,950
have

81
00:04:30,600 --> 00:04:31,200
their names

82
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:32,470
cleared.

83
00:04:35,680 --> 00:04:36,240
Your Lordship.

84
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:37,600
What are you going to do?

85
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:38,350
In three days,

86
00:04:39,190 --> 00:04:41,200
the Third Prince will visit
the imperial mausoleum.

87
00:04:42,070 --> 00:04:43,320
He'll have to pass
through Zhuque Forest.

88
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:44,240
Are you planning

89
00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:45,590
to assassinate him?

90
00:04:46,390 --> 00:04:47,590
Your Lordship, you mustn't!

91
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:49,600
The Third Prince
will soon be named Crown Prince.

92
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:51,200
Attacking him would be treason.

93
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:52,880
Please reconsider, Your Lordship.

94
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:54,390
My parents are dead.

95
00:04:55,070 --> 00:04:56,350
The witness died a horrible death.

96
00:04:57,160 --> 00:04:58,680
Justice is nowhere in sight.

97
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:01,510
There's no way out of this.

98
00:05:03,270 --> 00:05:05,240
He framed my parents
and caused their deaths.

99
00:05:06,430 --> 00:05:08,270
I'll make him pay.

100
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:23,710
Do you admit defeat?

101
00:05:26,040 --> 00:05:26,760
Let's take a break.

102
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:28,390
All right.

103
00:05:29,310 --> 00:05:31,510
I'll go easy on you, then.

104
00:05:33,310 --> 00:05:34,590
You really don't have
a care in the world.

105
00:05:35,390 --> 00:05:36,680
We were in such danger yesterday,

106
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:39,240
yet you're still so happy today.

107
00:05:41,720 --> 00:05:42,150
Yuyuan,

108
00:05:42,630 --> 00:05:43,440
tell me the truth.

109
00:05:44,160 --> 00:05:45,240
Do you have feelings for Shen Cheng?

110
00:05:46,160 --> 00:05:47,560
You kept calling

111
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:49,350
his name all night.

112
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:54,710
You really like him?

113
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:55,950
What's so great about him?

114
00:05:56,750 --> 00:05:57,750
He's always so stone-faced.

115
00:05:57,750 --> 00:05:58,880
He never even smiles at anyone.

116
00:05:59,160 --> 00:06:00,120
He doesn't deserve you.

117
00:06:02,870 --> 00:06:04,560
You don't get it.

118
00:06:04,870 --> 00:06:06,310
Guys who are hard to get

119
00:06:06,310 --> 00:06:08,080
are just like that, okay?

120
00:06:10,070 --> 00:06:11,000
Well, I don't think Shen He

121
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:12,120
deserves you either.

122
00:06:12,830 --> 00:06:14,880
He's always grinning foolishly
behind that silly fan.

123
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:16,880
Does he think he's Princess Iron Fan?

124
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:19,560
I remember you used to

125
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:21,640
like the highly intelligent type.

126
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:23,000
He's just

127
00:06:23,190 --> 00:06:24,320
an optimist.

128
00:06:24,830 --> 00:06:26,240
What do you know?

129
00:06:26,830 --> 00:06:27,430
Besides,

130
00:06:27,430 --> 00:06:28,830
he's an excellent coroner.

131
00:06:29,070 --> 00:06:30,760
That takes intelligence, doesn't it?

132
00:06:31,510 --> 00:06:32,430
Well, look at you.

133
00:06:32,430 --> 00:06:33,600
Now you're talking back to your bestie

134
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:35,080
over some guy?

135
00:06:36,390 --> 00:06:37,950
I'll teach you a lesson.

136
00:06:42,160 --> 00:06:42,710
(Yuyuan,)

137
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:44,680
(my fate is no longer in my hands.)

138
00:06:44,950 --> 00:06:46,000
(I don't know what lies ahead.)

139
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:47,760
(The only thing I can do)

140
00:06:48,480 --> 00:06:50,000
(is set you free.)

141
00:07:10,190 --> 00:07:10,800
Get out.

142
00:07:13,870 --> 00:07:14,590
I won't.

143
00:07:17,210 --> 00:07:17,880
(Divorce Agreement)
Explain yourself.

144
00:07:17,880 --> 00:07:18,590
(Severance of Family Ties)
Explain yourself.

145
00:07:19,040 --> 00:07:20,000
Why did you write these?

146
00:07:22,660 --> 00:07:23,460
(Severance of Family Ties)

147
00:07:23,630 --> 00:07:24,080
Cheng,

148
00:07:25,270 --> 00:07:26,440
what exactly are you planning?

149
00:07:27,820 --> 00:07:29,580
(Severance of Family Ties)

150
00:07:29,600 --> 00:07:30,510
Good, you're here.

151
00:07:31,750 --> 00:07:32,640
Sign this.

152
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:34,710
From now on, whatever I do

153
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:38,030
will have nothing to do with you
or the entire Marquis's Manor.

154
00:07:39,310 --> 00:07:40,030
Shen Cheng.

155
00:07:41,920 --> 00:07:43,120
You'd better explain yourself.

156
00:07:43,950 --> 00:07:44,910
You don't need to know.

157
00:07:45,270 --> 00:07:47,390
You're planning to kill
the Third Prince yourself,

158
00:07:48,750 --> 00:07:49,320
aren't you?

159
00:07:51,830 --> 00:07:53,190
All these years, I've been secretly

160
00:07:53,190 --> 00:07:54,640
investigating the dancing girls
at Wangyue Pavilion.

161
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:56,830
Every clue points to the Third Prince.

162
00:07:57,430 --> 00:07:58,510
Judging by your reaction,

163
00:08:00,270 --> 00:08:01,480
our parents' deaths

164
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:02,510
must have been his doing.

165
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:03,470
Cheng.

166
00:08:05,240 --> 00:08:06,320
I want to go with you.

167
00:08:07,630 --> 00:08:08,350
You must stay here.

168
00:08:09,190 --> 00:08:09,880
Once I'm gone,

169
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:11,030
someone must look after the manor.

170
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:12,910
Grandmother needs someone
to care for her.

171
00:08:13,040 --> 00:08:14,600
Hundreds of people depend
on the manor for their livelihoods.

172
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:15,470
Someone needs to look after them.

173
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:17,350
What about you?

174
00:08:20,240 --> 00:08:20,830
I

175
00:08:25,630 --> 00:08:26,200
don't matter.

176
00:08:29,310 --> 00:08:30,470
You don't matter?

177
00:08:31,510 --> 00:08:33,150
You're the Heir
of Marquis Jingyuan's family.

178
00:08:33,150 --> 00:08:34,080
You're my brother.

179
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:36,830
How can you say you don't matter?

180
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,680
You can tell me what's going on.

181
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:41,590
Aren't we closer than anyone else?

182
00:08:49,240 --> 00:08:51,320
It's precisely because
you're my closest family

183
00:08:52,910 --> 00:08:54,560
that I need you to stay alive.

184
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:01,680
Cheng.

185
00:09:05,510 --> 00:09:07,520
Have you always thought

186
00:09:09,670 --> 00:09:11,110
I was a burden to you?

187
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:20,680
When we were little,

188
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:24,990
you tied me up in the ancestral hall.

189
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:29,110
You made me swear
to stay away from coroner's work.

190
00:09:30,870 --> 00:09:31,920
You thought I was too young

191
00:09:32,670 --> 00:09:33,680
to understand anything.

192
00:09:34,150 --> 00:09:34,830
And now,

193
00:09:37,670 --> 00:09:38,800
you're asking me to sign this.

194
00:09:39,550 --> 00:09:41,440
You still think
I don't understand anything.

195
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:44,920
But you've never asked me

196
00:09:45,550 --> 00:09:46,990
why I wanted to become a coroner.

197
00:09:47,790 --> 00:09:48,710
I didn't study to become a coroner

198
00:09:49,200 --> 00:09:50,710
just to defy you.

199
00:09:51,390 --> 00:09:52,710
I did it so we could

200
00:09:53,600 --> 00:09:54,720
investigate together

201
00:09:54,720 --> 00:09:55,680
and find out

202
00:09:56,960 --> 00:09:58,710
what really happened to our parents.

203
00:09:59,750 --> 00:10:00,750
I want to help you.

204
00:10:01,790 --> 00:10:03,950
I want to fight alongside you.

205
00:10:05,720 --> 00:10:06,630
Can't you

206
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:11,320
trust me this once?

207
00:10:22,600 --> 00:10:24,080
What are you brothers talking about?

208
00:10:24,600 --> 00:10:25,790
It's the Lantern Festival today.

209
00:10:25,790 --> 00:10:27,000
Shutiao and I bought some lanterns.

210
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:27,830
Come release them with us.

211
00:10:35,260 --> 00:10:37,580
♪No matter how
the universe changes tomorrow♪

212
00:10:37,580 --> 00:10:44,780
♪Right now,
I just want to stay by your side♪

213
00:10:44,780 --> 00:10:49,980
♪Let this kiss and this dream
last until we're old♪

214
00:10:51,180 --> 00:10:56,220
♪And hold on to all
the tenderness of this moment♪

215
00:10:57,580 --> 00:11:02,660
♪Following this heartbeat,
we'll retrace our steps♪

216
00:11:04,020 --> 00:11:09,140
♪As time goes by,
all I need is your gaze♪

217
00:11:10,420 --> 00:11:13,780
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪

218
00:11:32,540 --> 00:11:35,900
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪
